{"id":546,"slug":"burden-of-dreams","title":"Burden of Dreams","year":1982,"country":"United States, Germany","duration":96,"spine":287,"url":"https://www.criterion.com/films/546-burden-of-dreams","cover":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/criterion-production/films/df9e0ce9dbad8da4c49c491ed4ceae8e/FIhFagGKdU6OWpY40FUmL6P1nf7wSF_large.jpg","description":"For nearly five years, acclaimed German director Werner Herzog desperately tried to complete one of the most ambitious and difficult projects of his career­: Fitzcarraldo, the story of one man’s attempt to build an opera house deep in the Amazon jungle. Documentary filmmaker Les Blank captured the unfolding of this production, made more perilous by Herzog’s determination to shoot the most daunting scenes without models or special effects, including a sequence requiring hundreds of Indigenous locals to pull a full-size 320-ton steamship over a small mountain. The result is an extraordinary document of the filmmaking process and a unique look into the single-minded mission of one of cinema’s most fearless directors.","boxset":0,"scraped":1,"directors":[{"name":"Les Blank","slug":"les-blank"}],"cast":[{"actor":"Werner Herzog","role":null,"slug":"werner-herzog"},{"actor":"Klaus Kinski","role":null,"slug":"klaus-kinski"},{"actor":"Claudia Cardinale","role":null,"slug":"claudia-cardinale"},{"actor":"Jason Robards","role":null,"slug":"jason-robards"},{"actor":"Mick Jagger","role":null,"slug":"mick-jagger"},{"actor":"Alfredo de Río Tambo","role":null,"slug":"alfredo-de-rio-tambo"},{"actor":"Elia de Río Ene","role":null,"slug":"elia-de-rio-ene"},{"actor":"Nelson de Río Cenepa","role":null,"slug":"nelson-de-rio-cenepa"},{"actor":"Huerequeque Enrique Bohorquez","role":null,"slug":"huerequeque-enrique-bohorquez"},{"actor":"Carmen Correa","role":null,"slug":"carmen-correa"},{"actor":"David Pérez Espinosa","role":null,"slug":"david-perez-espinosa"},{"actor":"Miguel Ángel Fuentes","role":null,"slug":"miguel-angel-fuentes"},{"actor":"Father